      tech_short: 'tech_short',
      features_long:
        '<p><span style="background-color:transparent;color:#212529;">As a developer at <u>Velzon</u>, I played a pivotal role in shaping our clients\' digital journeys by meticulously converting </span><span style="background-color:transparent;color:var(--rootColorFore4);"><u>HTML </u></span><span style="background-color:transparent;color:#212529;">templates into versatile <u>frameworks</u>. My role revolved around crafting dynamic admin dashboard templates for </span><span style="background-color:transparent;color:var(--rootColorFore4);"><u>React</u></span><span style="background-color:transparent;color:#212529;">, </span><span style="background-color:transparent;color:var(--rootColorFore4);"><u>Next.js</u></span><span style="background-color:transparent;color:#212529;">, and </span><span style="background-color:transparent;color:var(--rootColorFore4);"><u>Node.js</u> </span><span style="background-color:transparent;color:#212529;">environments, ensuring our clients have a tailored solution for their specific needs. This endeavor involved translating cutting-edge features into functional components while leveraging an array of modern technologies.</span><br><span style="background-color:transparent;color:#212529;">&nbsp;</span></p><h2><strong>Key Modules and Contributions:</strong></h2><p>&nbsp;</p><ul><li><span style="background-color:transparent;color:#212529;"><strong>Framework Adaptation and Transformation:</strong></span><br><span style="background-color:transparent;color:#212529;">I spearheaded the conversion of HTML templates into powerful admin dashboard templates for React, Next.js, and Node.js. This strategic initiative allowed us to offer our clients a diverse range of options, each optimized for specific framework requirements.</span></li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><ul><li><span style="background-color:transparent;color:#212529;"><strong>Dynamic Feature Integration as Components:</strong></span><br><span style="background-color:transparent;color:#212529;">&nbsp;I skillfully translated the innovative features of our new templates into reusable components for React and Next.js. By meticulously breaking down complex functionalities into modular components, I ensured a seamless integration process for our clients\' projects.&nbsp;</span></li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><ul><li><span style="background-color:transparent;color:#212529;"><strong>Node.js Backend Integration:</strong></span><br><span style="background-color:transparent;color:#212529;">Beyond the frontend, I ventured into the realm of Node.js to create backend components that perfectly complemented the dashboard templates. This holistic approach enabled clients to harness a comprehensive admin solution with a consistent tech stack.</span></li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><ul><li><strong>&nbsp;</strong><span style="background-color:transparent;color:#212529;"><strong>CkEditor Integration and Customization:</strong></span><br><span style="background-color:transparent;color:#212529;">I successfully integrated and customized CkEditor to empower content management within the dashboard templates. This provided clients with a robust text editing experience, enhancing their ability to manage content seamlessly.</span></li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><ul><li><strong>&nbsp;</strong><span style="background-color:transparent;color:#212529;"><strong>Interactive Charts and Data Visualization:</strong></span><br><span style="background-color:transparent;color:#212529;">I incorporated dynamic chart libraries to offer insightful data visualization options. By integrating interactive charts, I ensured that our clients\' dashboard templates went beyond aesthetics and provided actionable insights.</span></li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Responsibilities And Achievements:</strong></h2><p>&nbsp;</p><ul><li><span style="background-color:transparent;color:#212529;"><strong>Framework Transformation: </strong>Led the conversion of HTML templates into React, Next.js, and Node.js admin dashboard templates, expanding our service offerings.</span></li><li><span style="background-color:transparent;color:#212529;"><strong>Component Modularization: </strong>Transformed advanced features into reusable components, ensuring smooth integration and flexibility for clients\' projects.</span></li><li><span style="background-color:transparent;color:#212529;"><strong>Backend Development: </strong>Developed backend components using Node.js to provide a holistic admin solution with consistent technologies.</span></li><li><span style="background-color:transparent;color:#212529;"><strong>CkEditor Customization: </strong>Integrated and customized CkEditor for enhanced content management, enabling seamless text editing within the templates.</span></li><li><span style="background-color:transparent;color:#212529;"><strong>Data Visualization:</strong> Utilized chart libraries to create interactive data visualization tools, elevating the templates from visual assets to actionable insights.</span></li></ul><h2><strong>Tech Stack:</strong></h2><p>&nbsp;</p><ul><li><span style="background-color:transparent;color:#212529;"><strong>Frontend:</strong> React, Next.js, Bootstrap, JavaScript, TypeScript, HTML, CSS</span></li><li><span style="background-color:transparent;color:#212529;"><strong>&nbsp;Backend: </strong>Node.js</span></li><li><span style="background-color:transparent;color:#212529;"><strong>Content Management: </strong>CKEditor</span></li><li><span style="background-color:transparent;color:#212529;"><strong>Data Visualization:</strong> Chart Libraries</span></li><li><span style="background-color:transparent;color:#212529;"><strong>Deployment:</strong> Docker, AWS Cloud Services</span></li><li><span style="background-color:transparent;color:#212529;"><strong>Version Control: </strong>GitHub</span></li></ul><p><span style="background-color:transparent;color:#212529;">Through my contributions at <u>Velzon</u>, I demonstrated the ability to bridge design and functionality, providing clients with tailored admin dashboard templates across a range of frameworks. By leveraging <u>React</u>,<u> Next.js</u>, <u>Node.js</u>, and various technologies, I ensured that our templates offered not only aesthetic excellence but also seamless functionality and versatile features.</span></p>',
